_id":"tourism_resources","name":"杉ヶ峯","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 火山","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"04302","municipality_pref":"宮城県","municipality_name":"七ヶ宿町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"102"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.4582061767578,38.105804443359375]}}],"display_comment_original":"七ヶ宿町周辺には、近世村の記憶として湯原村、滑津村、関村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、湯原番所跡、湯原館跡、大梁川銀山跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、湯原村、滑津村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["安藤太郎","大葉亀之進"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["滑津大滝","長老湖","玉の木原水芭蕉群生地","不忘山","道の駅七ヶ宿","羽州街道の宿で残存の4か所（関宿・滑津宿・峠田宿・湯原宿）","みやぎ蔵王七ヶ宿スキー場","南蔵王青少年旅行村"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%83%E3%83%B6%E5%AE%BF%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11451286","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q47470194","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%AE%89%E8%97%A4%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E4%B8%83%E3%83%B6%E5%AE%BF%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"七ヶ宿町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110378504","wikidata_qid":"Q1204398","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%83%E3%83%B6%E5%AE%BF%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%AE%89%E8%97%A4%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E4%B8%83%E3%83%B6%E5%AE%BF%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}